# Lumina Ledger Design System Instructions
1. Palette: Background MUST be #09090b (bg-zinc-950). Never pure black #000000.
2. Borders: Single-pixel translucent lines (border border-white/10).
3. Glass Surfaces: bg-zinc-900/50 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 shadow-2xl.
4. Typography: Geist / Inter for general UI; JetBrains Mono for monetary values ($X,XXX.XX), invoice IDs, dates, and tables.
5. Accents: Restrained indigo (bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 border-indigo-500/20).
6. Badges: Paid (emerald), Pending (amber), Overdue (rose), Processing (indigo).
